## After Every Finding — 4 Questions

1. **What technology is this?** (product + version, not just port)
2. **What do I gain if this works?** (shell / creds / file read / pivot)
3. **What is the logical next step?** (one chain link forward)
4. **Did I write result + next objective in Timeline?**

