### 2. Service enum

```bash
sudo nmap -p- -T4 --min-rate 2000 --open 10.129.32.211 -oN scan/reactor--tcp-full.txt
sudo nmap -p <ports> -Pn -sV -sC 10.129.32.211 -oN scan/reactor--deep.txt
```

**Result:**
@file: scan/reactor--tcp-full.txt
- 2 open ports: 22 (ssh) and 3000 (ppp)

**Stack notes:**
@file: scan/reactor--deep.txt
- ssh: OpenSSH 9.6p1 Ubuntu 3ubuntu13.16 (Ubuntu Linux; protocol 2.0)
- ppp?: Next.js web app due to "X-Powered-By: Next.js"
- On Next.js web, only GET, HEAD are allowed due to "Allow: GET, Allow: HEAD"

**Next:**
Performing web enum and footprinting. 

